      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Missing the root when it is hidden. <b>verdict</b> is <i>ver</i> (true) + <i>dict</i> (say): a jury’s “true saying.” <b>indict</b> keeps <i>dict</i> in its spelling but drops the <i>c</i> sound: in-DITE. And <i>mand</i> also hides in <b>commend</b> (to praise: once, to entrust someone to another)."
